<div class="mir-policies">
  <details open><summary>If we can't fix it</summary><div><p>You don't pay for the repair. We refund the repair price and ship your device back free. Specialized repairs: the diagnostic fee covers the work done; nothing else is charged.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>If we find more damage</summary><div><p>We stop and email you a new quote. Nothing extra happens without your approval. If you decline, we fix only what you booked (if that's still possible) or refund it, and ship it back.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>If your part tier goes out of stock after booking</summary><div><p>We email you three options: wait for the part (we'll give you a date), switch to another tier and pay or get refunded the difference, or cancel for a full refund.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>Quote expiry</summary><div><p>Quotes are valid for {{ settings.mir_quote_valid_days | default: 14 }} days. Once you book, your price is locked even if prices change before your device arrives.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>If it arrives damaged</summary><div><p>We photograph every parcel and device when it's opened. If it arrives damaged in transit, we file the insurance claim, show you the photos, and quote any extra repair before doing anything. You never pay for carrier damage on our labels.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>Lost in transit</summary><div><p>Every label includes declared value and insurance. If a parcel is lost, we handle the claim and replace or refund the device at its declared value, plus refund anything you paid.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>Unclaimed devices</summary><div><p>If we can't reach you after a repair or a declined quote, we try email and phone for 60 days. After 90 days, unclaimed devices are responsibly recycled and your data is securely wiped.</p></div></details>
  <details><summary>Data privacy</summary><div><p>We only access what's needed to test the repair. We never copy, browse, sell or keep your data. Data recovery files are deleted from our systems 30 days after you confirm you've received them.</p></div></details>
</div>
